# INVWINUB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: users at level 3.
# CTRL-E on NEWBIE with a password typed twice resets it (USER RESET), the
# list fetched again.  DEL on ADMIN, the last administrator, asks first
# and is refused by the server in a message box; so are, in the dialog
# on the status, ADMIN disabled, and on the level, ADMIN demoted, each
# dialog then cancelled with its changes discarded.  ADMIN disabled with
# a new password typed has the password saved (USER RESET) before the
# server refuses the rest: a message box says so, then the refusal shows
# on the status.  DEL on READER: No keeps it, Yes deletes it.  After
# File > Log out, NEWBIE logs in with the new password and must
# change it: the forced change, whose Cancel logs out; the end by ESC
# from the login dialog.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINUB.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A U
# from NEWBIE's status past the user name, the full name, the group and
# the level to the password
K DOWN DOWN CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T Fresh1986
K TAB
T Fresh1986
K ENTER
S RESET
K HOME DEL
S DELQ
K Y
S LASTADM
K ENTER CTRL-E
T D
K ENTER
S NODISABL
K ESC Y CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 1
K ENTER
S NODEMOTE
K ESC Y CTRL-E
T D
# from the status past the user name, the full name, the group and the
# level to the password
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T Admin1987
K TAB
T Admin1987
K ENTER
S PWONLY
K ENTER
S PWREFUSD
K ESC Y END DEL
K N
S KEPT
K DEL Y
S DELETED
K ALT-F L STAB
T NEWBIE
K TAB
T Fresh1986
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG
K ESC
S LOGIN
K ESC
